+ *
+ * Dates and times are formatted for the user's locale with GetDateFormatEx and GetTimeFormatEx, in the local time
+ * zone. A template is either keywords ("shortdate", "longtime", "month day", "dayofweek.full", ...), shown in the
+ * locale's own formats, or a pattern ("{month.full} {day.integer}"), whose parts are formatted one by one.
